<!-- ATmega328P peripheral registers for ArduDebug.
     Generated from the Microchip ATmega328P device file (ATDF, Apache-2.0).
     Data space addresses (0x800000 + address) as GDB sees them.
     Left out on purpose: UDR0 and SPDR (reading them changes the hardware state;
     UDR0 is the debugger connection), CPU registers (shown in the Registers view).
     USART0 is read-only: changing it would cut the debugger connection. -->
